cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these orbits, please cite it like this."
title: "Orbit Hunter 0.4.0, with PeriCont: continuation of relative periodic orbits of the planar equal-mass three-body problem through close two-body approaches"
authors:
  - given-names: Utshob
    family-names: Kandel
abstract: "Search for periodic orbits of the planar equal-mass three-body problem. Version 0.3.0 added PeriCont, the continuation of families of relative periodic orbits through close two-body approaches; version 0.4.0 adds options that make its driver faster or change its step control (all off by default), a stricter hand-over to the 50 digit continuation and fixes from reviews."
repository-code: "https://github.com/Utshob-k/orbit-hunter"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.4.0
date-released: TAGDATE
keywords:
  - three-body problem
  - periodic orbits
  - WebGPU
